(6712255, 1004191, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very eye-pleasing image.  Love the skyline.  Great job on the sky exposure and cloud detail.</td>', 'Very eye-pleasing image.  Love the skyline.  Great job on the sky exposure and cloud detail.', '2012-03-16 08:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712257, 1004511, 54446, '<td valign="top">Super job on the crepuscular rays.</td>', 'Super job on the crepuscular rays.', '2012-03-16 08:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712271, 1004683, 54446, '<td valign="top">Magnificent sun star.  I love the sky.  The image could have been better had you allowed more shadows in the areas which would have been naturally in silhouette.  By HDR illuminating so many normally dark areas to such a mid tone gray, it hurts the natural appearance.  I don''t mean you had to let all go to silhouette, but make you could have made the scene look more like what the human eye can see when looking into shadows against the sunshine.</td>', 'Magnificent sun star.  I love the sky.  The image could have been better had you allowed more shadows in the areas which would have been naturally in silhouette.  By HDR illuminating so many normally dark areas to such a mid tone gray, it hurts the natural appearance.  I don''t mean you had to let all go to silhouette, but make you could have made the scene look more like what the human eye can see when looking into shadows against the sunshine.', '2012-03-16 09:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712276, 1004676, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is my pick for the blue ribbon.  It''s a great scene with the rain shafts filtering the sun.  And, the ship and harbor are great elements of interest.  Great tonal range and superb composition.  10</td>', 'This is my pick for the blue ribbon.  It''s a great scene with the rain shafts filtering the sun.  And, the ship and harbor are great elements of interest.  Great tonal range and superb composition.  10', '2012-03-16 09:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712278, 1004783, 54446, '<td valign="top">I hope this will ribbon for you.  You''ve captured wonderful luminous glow on the water, interesting detail and a nicely detailed sky.  Against a bright sun, this is a major accomplishment.  9</td>', 'I hope this will ribbon for you.  You''ve captured wonderful luminous glow on the water, interesting detail and a nicely detailed sky.  Against a bright sun, this is a major accomplishment.  9', '2012-03-16 09:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712282, 1004769, 54446, '<td valign="top">Love that horizon line placement choice.  Easily the most accomplished image in this challenge.  The sky is just right.  The ocean is super interesting.  I expect this to ribbon.  Great job!  9</td>', 'Love that horizon line placement choice.  Easily the most accomplished image in this challenge.  The sky is just right.  The ocean is super interesting.  I expect this to ribbon.  Great job!  9', '2012-03-16 09:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
