(6712556, 1004815, 141319, '<td valign="top">For me this composition doesn''t work. In the B&amp;W the periwinkle doesn''t really stand out enough and my eye goes to the light reflection of the sun rather than the focused front and even before it goes to your supposed focus point it then goes to the bridge ... Just seems too much IMO. I like the idea of having something small in the forgroound to focus on, juast think that then the background should have been different.</td>', 'For me this composition doesn''t work. In the B&W the periwinkle doesn''t really stand out enough and my eye goes to the light reflection of the sun rather than the focused front and even before it goes to your supposed focus point it then goes to the bridge ... Just seems too much IMO. I like the idea of having something small in the forgroound to focus on, juast think that then the background should have been different.', '2012-03-16 12:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
