(6713625, 1004785, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the way you think.  This works well for the challenge, especially for those of us who find it hard to break away when we''d like to shoot!</td>', 'I like the way you think.  This works well for the challenge, especially for those of us who find it hard to break away when we''d like to shoot!', '2012-03-16 23:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713630, 1003400, 30982, '<td valign="top">A glorious tree accented by that perfect bit of s-shaped road.</td>', 'A glorious tree accented by that perfect bit of s-shaped road.', '2012-03-16 23:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713631, 1004794, 30982, '<td valign="top">Made me smile.  What a lovely interpretation!</td>', 'Made me smile.  What a lovely interpretation!', '2012-03-16 23:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713692, 1003679, 10785, '<td valign="top">Red sun in morning, sailors take warning. Red sun at night, sailors delight. If black and white, sailors take flight!!</td>', 'Red sun in morning, sailors take warning. Red sun at night, sailors delight. If black and white, sailors take flight!!', '2012-03-17 00:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713711, 1003743, 58610, '<td valign="top">Tremendous scene. Way too dark. There''s a lot of lost detail in those shadows I''d really like to have seen.</td>', 'Tremendous scene. Way too dark. There''s a lot of lost detail in those shadows I''d really like to have seen.', '2012-03-17 00:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713712, 1004755, 58610, '<td valign="top">Clouds. Maybe you should''ve included some ground.</td>', 'Clouds. Maybe you should''ve included some ground.', '2012-03-17 00:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713865, 1003788, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice use of Rule of Thirds to compose your photo, though the foreground doesn''t quite make sense to me. Overall, a little to dark without enough detail.</td>', 'Nice use of Rule of Thirds to compose your photo, though the foreground doesn''t quite make sense to me. Overall, a little to dark without enough detail.', '2012-03-17 08:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713866, 1003679, 58610, '<td valign="top">It means, since you''re in B&amp;W you don''t need to worry ;) Nicely composed with good contrast with boat and water, though on my monitor the water is a bit dark.</td>', 'It means, since you''re in B&W you don''t need to worry ;) Nicely composed with good contrast with boat and water, though on my monitor the water is a bit dark.', '2012-03-17 08:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713868, 1004810, 58610, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, though the square crop doesn''t work for me. A little less foreground would have improved this IMO.</td>', 'Interesting composition, though the square crop doesn''t work for me. A little less foreground would have improved this IMO.', '2012-03-17 08:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713869, 1004781, 58610, '<td valign="top">Your idea of balance is interesting. Perhaps a landscape format would have served this better.</td>', 'Your idea of balance is interesting. Perhaps a landscape format would have served this better.', '2012-03-17 08:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713870, 1004746, 58610, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. I might have left out the water in the foreground; perhaps cropped in the middle of the beach, which certainly would have begged the question.</td>', 'Interesting subject. I might have left out the water in the foreground; perhaps cropped in the middle of the beach, which certainly would have begged the question.', '2012-03-17 08:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713871, 1004221, 58610, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky. Sort of a cotton candy texture. Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful sky. Sort of a cotton candy texture. Nicely done.', '2012-03-17 08:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713873, 1004791, 58610, '<td valign="top">A photo this dark tells me you really didn''t have a subject to show us.</td>', 'A photo this dark tells me you really didn''t have a subject to show us.', '2012-03-17 08:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713876, 1004531, 58610, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d have placed the quahog? shell in the light so we could have seen it. It would have made this picture much more interesting to  have it forward and just to the left of the pitcher on the lazy Susan.</td>', 'I wish you''d have placed the quahog? shell in the light so we could have seen it. It would have made this picture much more interesting to  have it forward and just to the left of the pitcher on the lazy Susan.', '2012-03-17 08:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713877, 1004441, 58610, '<td valign="top">What''s the subject? If it''s the foreground, it needs more detail. If it''s the sunset, the tree detracts.</td>', 'What''s the subject? If it''s the foreground, it needs more detail. If it''s the sunset, the tree detracts.', '2012-03-17 08:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713888, 1003400, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, though I would have liked the sun a little further from the edge of the photo. Walking to your right a bit would have placed the sun behind the tree, which might have created an interesting texture with the branches, as well as blocking some of the brightness from the sun thereby giving you more detail in the foreground, and more middle greys in the grass. On the other hand, that might have compromised the road placement. Tough choices we photogs must make.</td>', 'Nicely composed, though I would have liked the sun a little further from the edge of the photo. Walking to your right a bit would have placed the sun behind the tree, which might have created an interesting texture with the branches, as well as blocking some of the brightness from the sun thereby giving you more detail in the foreground, and more middle greys in the grass. On the other hand, that might have compromised the road placement. Tough choices we photogs must make.', '2012-03-17 08:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713890, 1004792, 58610, '<td valign="top">Minimal.</td>', 'Minimal.', '2012-03-17 08:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713895, 1004812, 58610, '<td valign="top">Great sky. I always appreciate the dilemma of wanting to capture a towering sky in portrait format. It rarely works well. Another option is taking a series of shots in portrait format and stitching the shots together to make a panorama. Of course, that wouldn''t have worked for this challenge.</td>', 'Great sky. I always appreciate the dilemma of wanting to capture a towering sky in portrait format. It rarely works well. Another option is taking a series of shots in portrait format and stitching the shots together to make a panorama. Of course, that wouldn''t have worked for this challenge.', '2012-03-17 08:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713896, 1004797, 58610, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.</td>', 'Interesting abstract.', '2012-03-17 08:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713900, 1004711, 58610, '<td valign="top">While very dramatic, this doesn''t tell me much about the subjects in the foreground because it is so dark. Another option would have been to wait until the sun is just setting or has set completely (we already know what the sun looks like) to reduce the brightness and give more detail in the foreground.</td>', 'While very dramatic, this doesn''t tell me much about the subjects in the foreground because it is so dark. Another option would have been to wait until the sun is just setting or has set completely (we already know what the sun looks like) to reduce the brightness and give more detail in the foreground.', '2012-03-17 09:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713902, 1004726, 58610, '<td valign="top">Back up and use landscape format next time.</td>', 'Back up and use landscape format next time.', '2012-03-17 09:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713904, 1004805, 58610, '<td valign="top">Wow. Kind of like the 4th of July.</td>', 'Wow. Kind of like the 4th of July.', '2012-03-17 09:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713913, 1003849, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the lens flare detracts IMO. Sometimes holding your hat or hand just above the lens to block the flare works.</td>', 'Nice composition, but the lens flare detracts IMO. Sometimes holding your hat or hand just above the lens to block the flare works.', '2012-03-17 09:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713918, 1004071, 58610, '<td valign="top">Overall, a bit too much contrast for my taste, though there is some nice detail in the water.</td>', 'Overall, a bit too much contrast for my taste, though there is some nice detail in the water.', '2012-03-17 09:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713922, 1004564, 58610, '<td valign="top">I wish I could tell what is floating out in the water. Boats, birds? Also, I don''t think the graininess helps this photo much.</td>', 'I wish I could tell what is floating out in the water. Boats, birds? Also, I don''t think the graininess helps this photo much.', '2012-03-17 09:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713928, 1004205, 58610, '<td valign="top">The scene is beautiful. I don''t understand your choice of colorizing it for a B&amp;W photo challenge. A little brighter foreground would have brought out needed detail.</td>', 'The scene is beautiful. I don''t understand your choice of colorizing it for a B&W photo challenge. A little brighter foreground would have brought out needed detail.', '2012-03-17 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713942, 1004191, 58610, '<td valign="top">I had to look it up on the internet, and I''m still not sure how to apply it to your photo. In any case, we''re only dealing with one star here, and it is nicely placed to create an interesting silhouette of your skyline.</td>', 'I had to look it up on the internet, and I''m still not sure how to apply it to your photo. In any case, we''re only dealing with one star here, and it is nicely placed to create an interesting silhouette of your skyline.', '2012-03-17 09:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713944, 1004624, 58610, '<td valign="top">Unlike many others in this challenge, you have succeeded in creating interest in your foreground by using it as a silhouette against a very dramatic sky. Nice creativity and balance.</td>', 'Unlike many others in this challenge, you have succeeded in creating interest in your foreground by using it as a silhouette against a very dramatic sky. Nice creativity and balance.', '2012-03-17 09:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713947, 1004721, 58610, '<td valign="top">No subject and little detail in the sky. Did you use a tripod?</td>', 'No subject and little detail in the sky. Did you use a tripod?', '2012-03-17 09:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713951, 1004815, 58610, '<td valign="top">I applaud your attempt to create a bokeh effect with the sunrise, but your subject isn''t quite strong enough IMO, and your exposure is a bit dark overall. Perhaps if you''d gotten a little closer the shells to bring out their interesting detail.</td>', 'I applaud your attempt to create a bokeh effect with the sunrise, but your subject isn''t quite strong enough IMO, and your exposure is a bit dark overall. Perhaps if you''d gotten a little closer the shells to bring out their interesting detail.', '2012-03-17 09:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713952, 1004421, 58610, '<td valign="top">A little brighter and you would have had a subject. I little darker would have made a silhouette. You got caught in the middle.</td>', 'A little brighter and you would have had a subject. I little darker would have made a silhouette. You got caught in the middle.', '2012-03-17 09:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713955, 1004764, 58610, '<td valign="top">A striking composition, albeit an unconventional landscape. I also see possibilities for non-negative and landscape format compositions (especially with such mirror perfect reflections).</td>', 'A striking composition, albeit an unconventional landscape. I also see possibilities for non-negative and landscape format compositions (especially with such mirror perfect reflections).', '2012-03-17 09:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713957, 1004425, 58610, '<td valign="top">I think I might have gone with more water and less sky since the detail in the sky is less interesting even than the foreground. That would have made the silhouetted portion more dominant and therefore more interesting.</td>', 'I think I might have gone with more water and less sky since the detail in the sky is less interesting even than the foreground. That would have made the silhouetted portion more dominant and therefore more interesting.', '2012-03-17 09:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713968, 1004728, 58610, '<td valign="top">Good golly, what a scene! There''s so much interest here it hurts. A few small criticisms- much too dark and contrasty for my taste, the foreground tree distracts, and did you shoot this with the widest lens you had, because, wow what a scene. I don''t know what was going on to your right, but if you could have moved over and lowered your camera to bring those foreground rocks more into play it would really have make this incredible.</td>', 'Good golly, what a scene! There''s so much interest here it hurts. A few small criticisms- much too dark and contrasty for my taste, the foreground tree distracts, and did you shoot this with the widest lens you had, because, wow what a scene. I don''t know what was going on to your right, but if you could have moved over and lowered your camera to bring those foreground rocks more into play it would really have make this incredible.', '2012-03-17 09:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713971, 1004604, 58610, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, though the one dark cloud seems overpowering and unbalanced. Just bad luck. A nice composition well exposed.</td>', 'Wonderful, though the one dark cloud seems overpowering and unbalanced. Just bad luck. A nice composition well exposed.', '2012-03-17 10:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713985, 1004782, 58610, '<td valign="top">Without a strong subject your composition lacks interest, though you have successfully captured some interesting clouds.</td>', 'Without a strong subject your composition lacks interest, though you have successfully captured some interesting clouds.', '2012-03-17 10:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713995, 1003725, 58610, '<td valign="top">One of the few portrait format landscape shots that really work in this challenge. I think this would have been improved with less contrast/blacks and more middle greys, especially in the foreground rocks and water.</td>', 'One of the few portrait format landscape shots that really work in this challenge. I think this would have been improved with less contrast/blacks and more middle greys, especially in the foreground rocks and water.', '2012-03-17 10:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714015, 1003844, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice gradation throughout the photo from bright white to black. Nicely composed with strong subjects and good detail. Could have been a tad brighter overall,and I would have liked a few more highlight details in the foreground waves. Well done!</td>', 'Nice gradation throughout the photo from bright white to black. Nicely composed with strong subjects and good detail. Could have been a tad brighter overall,and I would have liked a few more highlight details in the foreground waves. Well done!', '2012-03-17 10:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714017, 1003846, 58610, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Too dark to appreciate the details.</td>', 'Great idea. Too dark to appreciate the details.', '2012-03-17 10:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714024, 1004795, 58610, '<td valign="top">A tad less sky and this composition rocks (use the rule of thirds). Love the mood, and you nailed the gradation from white to black.</td>', 'A tad less sky and this composition rocks (use the rule of thirds). Love the mood, and you nailed the gradation from white to black.', '2012-03-17 10:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714029, 1004785, 58610, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B&amp;W composition with strong subject and perfect exposure.</td>', 'Beautiful B&W composition with strong subject and perfect exposure.', '2012-03-17 10:20:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6714032, 1004683, 58610, '<td valign="top">A little less contrast and this is a 10. Incredible scene!</td>', 'A little less contrast and this is a 10. Incredible scene!', '2012-03-17 10:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714038, 1004806, 58610, '<td valign="top">Don''t neglect your foreground even with such a fantastic sky. Bracket your shots and combine them in Photoshop, or use HDR software to bring out details in the darkness. You missed the potential of this shot by leaving out the foreground.</td>', 'Don''t neglect your foreground even with such a fantastic sky. Bracket your shots and combine them in Photoshop, or use HDR software to bring out details in the darkness. You missed the potential of this shot by leaving out the foreground.', '2012-03-17 10:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714095, 1004293, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines and composition, I don''t mind the blown out sun.</td>', 'Nice leading lines and composition, I don''t mind the blown out sun.', '2012-03-17 10:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714096, 1004683, 43774, '<td valign="top">Perfection!!!!</td>', 'Perfection!!!!', '2012-03-17 10:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714154, 1003744, 58610, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the busyness of the vines in the foreground detracts from the overall beauty of this composition which is considerable. Sky is fabulous, gradation goes from black to white with many values of grey in between.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the busyness of the vines in the foreground detracts from the overall beauty of this composition which is considerable. Sky is fabulous, gradation goes from black to white with many values of grey in between.', '2012-03-17 12:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714164, 1004270, 58610, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. You timed is perfectly! Bright whites to blackness with all shades of grey and plenty of detail. Interesting photo and good composition. Tops.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. You timed is perfectly! Bright whites to blackness with all shades of grey and plenty of detail. Interesting photo and good composition. Tops.', '2012-03-17 12:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714224, 1004744, 58610, '<td valign="top">Not sure this fits as sunset,  but it''s a very nice late afternoon shot with the soft, slanting light creating the soft shadows and wonderful reflections. Well composed with good detail in the middle greys.</td>', 'Not sure this fits as sunset,  but it''s a very nice late afternoon shot with the soft, slanting light creating the soft shadows and wonderful reflections. Well composed with good detail in the middle greys.', '2012-03-17 12:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714225, 1004111, 58610, '<td valign="top">Lacking a strong subject in the foreground and detail in the shadows, but a nice scene overall.</td>', 'Lacking a strong subject in the foreground and detail in the shadows, but a nice scene overall.', '2012-03-17 13:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714234, 1004293, 145829, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - feels a bit like too much of a hot spot, but that tends to happen with the sun.</td>', 'Nice shot - feels a bit like too much of a hot spot, but that tends to happen with the sun.', '2012-03-17 13:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714235, 1004561, 145829, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this photo</td>', 'I like the feel of this photo', '2012-03-17 13:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714236, 1003725, 145829, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection. The rocks look a bit odd, maybe too much def or something.</td>', 'Love the reflection. The rocks look a bit odd, maybe too much def or something.', '2012-03-17 13:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714237, 1004441, 145829, '<td valign="top">Nice! Only recommendation would be to straighten a bit, or slant more. Wish I got up for this one.</td>', 'Nice! Only recommendation would be to straighten a bit, or slant more. Wish I got up for this one.', '2012-03-17 13:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714238, 1003788, 145829, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. I love the reflection and shadows</td>', 'Wonderful shot. I love the reflection and shadows', '2012-03-17 13:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714239, 1003844, 145829, '<td valign="top">Love the line up of the bird and sun!</td>', 'Love the line up of the bird and sun!', '2012-03-17 13:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714241, 1003603, 145829, '<td valign="top">I like the composition wit the building and fence.</td>', 'I like the composition wit the building and fence.', '2012-03-17 13:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714242, 1004792, 145829, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to this.</td>', 'Nice approach to this.', '2012-03-17 13:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714243, 1004199, 58610, '<td valign="top">Incredibly beautiful scene and composition. Could just be the lay of the land, but horizon seems low on the right. Good detail and variation in grey values throughout.</td>', 'Incredibly beautiful scene and composition. Could just be the lay of the land, but horizon seems low on the right. Good detail and variation in grey values throughout.', '2012-03-17 13:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714247, 1004722, 58610, '<td valign="top">The starkness works here because of the silhouetted subject. Very dramatic and well composed.</td>', 'The starkness works here because of the silhouetted subject. Very dramatic and well composed.', '2012-03-17 13:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714248, 1004421, 145829, '<td valign="top">nice, good exposure</td>', 'nice, good exposure', '2012-03-17 13:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714249, 1003743, 145829, '<td valign="top">love it. nice fog and shadows</td>', 'love it. nice fog and shadows', '2012-03-17 13:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714251, 1004683, 145829, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful.', '2012-03-17 13:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714252, 1004769, 145829, '<td valign="top">wish i was there - outstanding</td>', 'wish i was there - outstanding', '2012-03-17 13:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714253, 1004682, 58610, '<td valign="top">Always an interesting perspective. Nicely exposed with white to black and all greys in between. Wishing for a little more detail in the ground, but just too late in the day (not to mention shooting through, most likely, scratchy window glass). Nice composition.</td>', 'Always an interesting perspective. Nicely exposed with white to black and all greys in between. Wishing for a little more detail in the ground, but just too late in the day (not to mention shooting through, most likely, scratchy window glass). Nice composition.', '2012-03-17 13:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714256, 1004559, 145829, '<td valign="top">nice shadows</td>', 'nice shadows', '2012-03-17 13:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714260, 1004513, 58610, '<td valign="top">hmmm. Not sure what you were going for here. Double exposure? Two files stacked, but not matching? Very abstract.</td>', 'hmmm. Not sure what you were going for here. Double exposure? Two files stacked, but not matching? Very abstract.', '2012-03-17 13:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714267, 1004757, 58610, '<td valign="top">Almost makes me dizzy. Was this taken with a Lens Baby? The loss of focus top and bottom make me think so. Anyway, strong composition and subject, good detail, good gradation from blacks to whites albeit a little too much contrast in the sky for my taste.</td>', 'Almost makes me dizzy. Was this taken with a Lens Baby? The loss of focus top and bottom make me think so. Anyway, strong composition and subject, good detail, good gradation from blacks to whites albeit a little too much contrast in the sky for my taste.', '2012-03-17 13:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714276, 1003468, 145829, '<td valign="top">Like the glare</td>', 'Like the glare', '2012-03-17 13:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714279, 1004803, 58610, '<td valign="top">Foreground is a little too dark and lacks detail in dark areas.</td>', 'Foreground is a little too dark and lacks detail in dark areas.', '2012-03-17 13:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714280, 1003849, 145829, '<td valign="top">Love it. The glare and road go well - fell like I should be on it</td>', 'Love it. The glare and road go well - fell like I should be on it', '2012-03-17 13:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714283, 1004794, 145829, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the twigs - almost like a web</td>', 'Nice effect with the twigs - almost like a web', '2012-03-17 13:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714284, 1004255, 58610, '<td valign="top">Tripod? A tack sharp outline and straight horizon would have made this pop.</td>', 'Tripod? A tack sharp outline and straight horizon would have made this pop.', '2012-03-17 13:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714286, 1004797, 145829, '<td valign="top">Very artistic</td>', 'Very artistic', '2012-03-17 13:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714287, 1004624, 145829, '<td valign="top">Very nice. NY?</td>', 'Very nice. NY?', '2012-03-17 13:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714293, 1004728, 145829, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. Is this RMNP? love the sky</td>', 'Outstanding. Is this RMNP? love the sky', '2012-03-17 13:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714295, 1004743, 58610, '<td valign="top">I like everything except the big tree in this. Perhaps you could have moved closer to the ball to take the trees out of play. Just thinking out loud.</td>', 'I like everything except the big tree in this. Perhaps you could have moved closer to the ball to take the trees out of play. Just thinking out loud.', '2012-03-17 13:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714296, 1004814, 58610, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract composition.</td>', 'Interesting abstract composition.', '2012-03-17 13:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714298, 1004205, 145829, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look black and white.</td>', 'This doesn''t look black and white.', '2012-03-17 13:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714300, 1004630, 58610, '<td valign="top">Wow! I do. Tremendous contrast without too much black. Great exposure and comp. Well timed shot. Bump to 10.</td>', 'Wow! I do. Tremendous contrast without too much black. Great exposure and comp. Well timed shot. Bump to 10.', '2012-03-17 13:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714301, 1004559, 58610, '<td valign="top">Thoughtful composition, well exposed with good detail and gradation from black to white. Nice photo. One of only two 10s for me.</td>', 'Thoughtful composition, well exposed with good detail and gradation from black to white. Nice photo. One of only two 10s for me.', '2012-03-17 13:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714565, 1004797, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very lovely original take on the challenge.</td>', 'A very lovely original take on the challenge.', '2012-03-17 18:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714566, 1004683, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice setting for your sunris!  Nice star effect of the sun, too.  Is this an HDR composite?  I ask because of the clouds near the top of the picture - either slow shutter or several exposures merged.  I like that effect.</td>', 'Very nice setting for your sunris!  Nice star effect of the sun, too.  Is this an HDR composite?  I ask because of the clouds near the top of the picture - either slow shutter or several exposures merged.  I like that effect.', '2012-03-17 18:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714567, 1004711, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes, the more normal sunrise that most folks see - from the road, through the wires.</td>', 'Yes, the more normal sunrise that most folks see - from the road, through the wires.', '2012-03-17 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714569, 1004559, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really nice use of a bike!</td>', 'Really nice use of a bike!', '2012-03-17 18:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714570, 1004630, 30982, '<td valign="top">Mornings like this make us realize just how much air traffice there really is out there!</td>', 'Mornings like this make us realize just how much air traffice there really is out there!', '2012-03-17 18:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714573, 1003849, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome flare - love the way the rays are spilling down from the hills.</td>', 'Awesome flare - love the way the rays are spilling down from the hills.', '2012-03-17 18:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714574, 1003468, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flare!!</td>', 'Beautiful flare!!', '2012-03-17 18:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714575, 1004680, 30982, '<td valign="top">From outer space... he comes in peace, I''m assuming...</td>', 'From outer space... he comes in peace, I''m assuming...', '2012-03-17 18:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714580, 1004764, 30982, '<td valign="top">Effective in negative, but also really quite nice when I stare at it for awhile, then turn and look at my blank white wall where it now appears as a positive.</td>', 'Effective in negative, but also really quite nice when I stare at it for awhile, then turn and look at my blank white wall where it now appears as a positive.', '2012-03-17 18:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714582, 1004810, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice catch of Venus and Mars.</td>', 'Very nice catch of Venus and Mars.', '2012-03-17 18:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714671, 1004757, 134859, '<td valign="top">This photo is the best out of the bunch, in my opinion.  Love the detail of the clouds, the boy sitting on the edge, the reflection of the sun in the water.  Truly a beautiful shot.</td>', 'This photo is the best out of the bunch, in my opinion.  Love the detail of the clouds, the boy sitting on the edge, the reflection of the sun in the water.  Truly a beautiful shot.', '2012-03-17 20:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714673, 1004792, 134859, '<td valign="top">Another one of my favorites from this challenge.  Completely different and out of the box!  Well done!!!</td>', 'Another one of my favorites from this challenge.  Completely different and out of the box!  Well done!!!', '2012-03-17 20:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714674, 1004221, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset shot.  Love the fluidity of the clouds.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset shot.  Love the fluidity of the clouds.', '2012-03-17 20:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714675, 1004758, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sunbursts.  Love this type of image.</td>', 'Gorgeous sunbursts.  Love this type of image.', '2012-03-17 20:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714677, 1004199, 134859, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail in the photo.  Love the sun, the rays coming right out of the photo.  Well done.  One of my favorites of the series</td>', 'Amazing detail in the photo.  Love the sun, the rays coming right out of the photo.  Well done.  One of my favorites of the series', '2012-03-17 20:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714678, 1004728, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail.  Lots of land.  Nice detail in the clouds as well.</td>', 'Beautiful detail.  Lots of land.  Nice detail in the clouds as well.', '2012-03-17 20:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714681, 1003844, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Love the detail of the waves rolling in.  The bird being lit up by the sun is great.  Such a beautiful shot!!!</td>', 'Nice shot.  Love the detail of the waves rolling in.  The bird being lit up by the sun is great.  Such a beautiful shot!!!', '2012-03-17 20:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714682, 1003725, 134859, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot.  Love the reflections on the water.</td>', 'Pretty shot.  Love the reflections on the water.', '2012-03-17 20:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714683, 1004733, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the darkness of the palm trees.  The waves rolling in are so peaceful looking.  Makes me want to go back to visit the beach.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the darkness of the palm trees.  The waves rolling in are so peaceful looking.  Makes me want to go back to visit the beach.', '2012-03-17 20:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714685, 1004806, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset.  Love the light shining behind the clouds.  Great capture.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset.  Love the light shining behind the clouds.  Great capture.', '2012-03-17 20:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714687, 1004683, 134859, '<td valign="top">Magnificent shot.  Love the detail here.  And the cloud cover is perfect.  Well done!!!</td>', 'Magnificent shot.  Love the detail here.  And the cloud cover is perfect.  Well done!!!', '2012-03-17 20:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714688, 1004421, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Love the peaceful serene feeling of this photograph!</td>', 'Great shot.  Love the peaceful serene feeling of this photograph!', '2012-03-17 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714689, 1004779, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  And including the boat and picnic table is a great touch.</td>', 'Nice shot.  And including the boat and picnic table is a great touch.', '2012-03-17 20:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714692, 1004554, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Love how you used the sun to the right of the photo, letting it cast light on the objects in focus.  Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Love how you used the sun to the right of the photo, letting it cast light on the objects in focus.  Well done.', '2012-03-17 20:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714914, 1004728, 60173, '<td valign="top">Great storm blowing in!</td>', 'Great storm blowing in!', '2012-03-17 23:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714916, 1004676, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is great without looking like it''s trying too hard. It''s a nice perspective. There''s something about the foreground cloudy haze that warms the image up. I feel that if those weren''t there it could be just a ho-hum picture. Well, if that and the great lighting weren''t there...</td>', 'This is great without looking like it''s trying too hard. It''s a nice perspective. There''s something about the foreground cloudy haze that warms the image up. I feel that if those weren''t there it could be just a ho-hum picture. Well, if that and the great lighting weren''t there...', '2012-03-17 23:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714939, 1004769, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well done. Likely ribbon. Nice environment in which to shoot. There''s a nice play on rocks vs. clouds for contrast.</td>', 'Well done. Likely ribbon. Nice environment in which to shoot. There''s a nice play on rocks vs. clouds for contrast.', '2012-03-18 00:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714941, 1004531, 108069, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. I can''t really explain it. It''s just soothing and interesting.</td>', 'I really like this photo. I can''t really explain it. It''s just soothing and interesting.', '2012-03-18 00:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714964, 1003468, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely flare. Great exposure range. Very nice photo.</td>', 'Lovely flare. Great exposure range. Very nice photo.', '2012-03-18 01:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714965, 1004814, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great contrast. Cool shot.</td>', 'Great contrast. Cool shot.', '2012-03-18 01:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714966, 1004766, 108069, '<td valign="top">Killer tones. Nice detail in the hill. Sweet photo.</td>', 'Killer tones. Nice detail in the hill. Sweet photo.', '2012-03-18 01:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714996, 1004757, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great range of tones. I''m bothered to be honest by the blurry foreground, and it''d be a sensational photo if you had cropped that out. As it is it''s just a great photo.</td>', 'Great range of tones. I''m bothered to be honest by the blurry foreground, and it''d be a sensational photo if you had cropped that out. As it is it''s just a great photo.', '2012-03-18 03:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714997, 1004797, 108069, '<td valign="top">Looks like my eye right now. Pretty darn cool.</td>', 'Looks like my eye right now. Pretty darn cool.', '2012-03-18 03:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6715234, 1004111, 124190, '<td valign="top">Beautiful organic capture.</td>', 'Beautiful organic capture.', '2012-03-18 14:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6715247, 1004533, 124190, '<td valign="top">....perchance to dream..........  10</td>', '....perchance to dream..........  10', '2012-03-18 14:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6715433, 1004766, 116575, '<td valign="top">i think the most epic part about this photo is how you incorporated the smile face 0.o  ;)</td>', 'i think the most epic part about this photo is how you incorporated the smile face 0.o  ;)', '2012-03-18 21:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6715463, 1004624, 46918, '<td valign="top">I love the SR-71 but the foreground is too dark</td>', 'I love the SR-71 but the foreground is too dark', '2012-03-18 22:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6715503, 1004719, 58610, '<td valign="top">Really like this. Wonderful detail throughout including in the darkest areas. The little  bit of grain underneath the cloud is unfortunate, but doesn''t detract too much. Nicely balanced composition.</td>', 'Really like this. Wonderful detail throughout including in the darkest areas. The little  bit of grain underneath the cloud is unfortunate, but doesn''t detract too much. Nicely balanced composition.', '2012-03-18 22:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
