(6721129, 1003844, 100831, '<td valign="top">WOO HOO Top 10 for YOU!!! <br/>Terrific shot and great finish!!!</td>', 'WOO HOO Top 10 for YOU!!! Terrific shot and great finish!!!', '2012-03-23 12:59:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6721153, 1004728, 54645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Timeless.</td>', 'Beautiful. Timeless.', '2012-03-23 13:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6721168, 1004199, 124255, '<td valign="top">Super happy to be on the front page!  The shot was three bracketed exposures at f22 so I have to give props to my wife Bev  and especially my dog Shelby for sitting still  during 1/20th, 1/80th and 1/5th second shots.   Thanks for all the comments, I actually had to tone down suns rays because they looked a little manufactured in my first attempt. <br/> <br/> We love this area and walk Shelby there once a week or so during the winter because it doesnt usually get heavy snow.   It is the location of one of the first Lewis &amp; Clark camps after entering the Rocky Mountains, Sacajawea started to remember her childhood home at this location (she was kidnaped as a child) and helped choose the route west.</td>', 'Super happy to be on the front page!  The shot was three bracketed exposures at f22 so I have to give props to my wife Bev  and especially my dog Shelby for sitting still  during 1/20th, 1/80th and 1/5th second shots.   Thanks for all the comments, I actually had to tone down suns rays because they looked a little manufactured in my first attempt.   We love this area and walk Shelby there once a week or so during the winter because it doesnt usually get heavy snow.   It is the location of one of the first Lewis & Clark camps after entering the Rocky Mountains, Sacajawea started to remember her childhood home at this location (she was kidnaped as a child) and helped choose the route west.', '2012-03-23 13:24:45.000000', NULL, 0),
