(6721483, 1004728, 108069, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo, Richard. I will admit though that I do agree with the comment from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=58610" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cogerox</a> below. The tree does little for me, and my eye honestly wants more of the lovely light that''s hitting the hills in the right of the frame. Foolish comments, probably, but a 10 should aspire to be an 11, no?</td>', 'Stunning photo, Richard. I will admit though that I do agree with the comment from  cogerox below. The tree does little for me, and my eye honestly wants more of the lovely light that''s hitting the hills in the right of the frame. Foolish comments, probably, but a 10 should aspire to be an 11, no?', '2012-03-23 17:53:57.000000', NULL, 0),
