(6721791, 1004810, 117474, '<td valign="top">I''d nearly say this image was over appreciated to be honest. I mean... it''s a sunset, right. Why do you have your sunset in black and white!? Colours would have made this image far more effective. Schoolboy error my friend.</td>', 'I''d nearly say this image was over appreciated to be honest. I mean... it''s a sunset, right. Why do you have your sunset in black and white!? Colours would have made this image far more effective. Schoolboy error my friend.', '2012-03-24 08:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6721796, 1004810, 62357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NiallOTuama:</b></div><hr/><i> Why do you have your sunset in black and white!? Colours would have made this image far more effective.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Not sure I totally follow this comment at all.  I thought this was an exceptionally well done image for this challenge.  Whilst I''m sure it''s wonderful in colour, that wasn''t the challenge, was it? Nice one.</td>', 'Originally posted by NiallOTuama: Why do you have your sunset in black and white!? Colours would have made this image far more effective. Not sure I totally follow this comment at all.  I thought this was an exceptionally well done image for this challenge.  Whilst I''m sure it''s wonderful in colour, that wasn''t the challenge, was it? Nice one.', '2012-03-24 08:17:32.000000', NULL, 0),
