(6924559, 1004728, 25355, '<td valign="top">For the Look Back 2012 Side Challenge.<br/>   Actually, I had thought the side challenge wasn''t about posting challenge entries, but I looked back at the original post and saw that I was wrong.<br/>   This is certainly deserving of a ribbon, and one of the great landscape photos on this site, probably. It would look even more fantastic in a larger size.</td>', 'For the Look Back 2012 Side Challenge.   Actually, I had thought the side challenge wasn''t about posting challenge entries, but I looked back at the original post and saw that I was wrong.   This is certainly deserving of a ribbon, and one of the great landscape photos on this site, probably. It would look even more fantastic in a larger size.', '2012-12-06 03:58:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6924675, 1004728, 138630, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful, Richard.  Looking at the color version I can see why you chose to include so much of the scene to the left, but for the black and white, I think I agree with those who want more of the right.  My heart aches for this place at this moment in time.</td>', 'Just beautiful, Richard.  Looking at the color version I can see why you chose to include so much of the scene to the left, but for the black and white, I think I agree with those who want more of the right.  My heart aches for this place at this moment in time.', '2012-12-06 07:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6924691, 1004728, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nam:</b></div><hr/><i> Just beautiful, Richard.  Looking at the color version I can see why you chose to include so much of the scene to the left, but for the black and white, I think I agree with those who want more of the right.  My heart aches for this place at this moment in time. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The composition of this scene was not accidental, nor casually chosen.  Including more of the scenery to the right destroys everything which is harmonious in this scene.</td>', 'Originally posted by nam: Just beautiful, Richard.  Looking at the color version I can see why you chose to include so much of the scene to the left, but for the black and white, I think I agree with those who want more of the right.  My heart aches for this place at this moment in time.  The composition of this scene was not accidental, nor casually chosen.  Including more of the scenery to the right destroys everything which is harmonious in this scene.', '2012-12-06 07:58:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6924795, 1004728, 67152, '<td valign="top">Wonderful rich landscape - the path of light areas from right through the valley really allows us to wonder the scene</td>', 'Wonderful rich landscape - the path of light areas from right through the valley really allows us to wonder the scene', '2012-12-06 09:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
