(6924966, 1004728, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pixelpig:</b></div><hr/><i> Richard, I''m sorry for the stress the wildfires cause to you &amp; to all who live there. Hopefully you will soon get some winter weather to help out. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for your comments.  I wish for some relief, too, but due to mismanagement of this wildfire (park officials were sure the snow would put out the fire, so they took no action), the fire is expected to burn until next Spring.</td>', 'Originally posted by pixelpig: Richard, I''m sorry for the stress the wildfires cause to you & to all who live there. Hopefully you will soon get some winter weather to help out.  Thanks for your comments.  I wish for some relief, too, but due to mismanagement of this wildfire (park officials were sure the snow would put out the fire, so they took no action), the fire is expected to burn until next Spring.', '2012-12-06 12:53:35.000000', NULL, 0),
